# Build-context exclusions (containerize-split-images, task 4.1).
# Every pattern is `**/`-anchored so it holds at any depth; a bare `data` would only match the
# context root and let server/data (live SQLite + audio) into the daemon.

# VCS metadata
**/.git
**/.gitignore

# dependencies and build output are always produced inside the image
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# live data (DATA_DIR content) and its e2e cousins
**/data
**/.data*
**/blobs
**/*.db
**/*.db-shm
**/*.db-wal
**/*.sqlite*

# secrets: every env file except the committed example
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# workspaces and trees that never ship in either image
**/companion
**/e2e
**/openspec
**/docs
**/scripts
**/.claude
**/.codegraph
**/.agents
**/.cursor
**/.impeccable
**/.graphify*
**/graphify-out
**/.mcp.json
**/skills-lock.json

# tests and test artifacts
**/*.test.*
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/fixtures
**/src/test
